window.products.push({"id":1170003,"name":"Toastess THG489 Smokeless Indoor Health Grill, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jU3gUNlCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No need to give up summertime grilling when the weather turns cold thanks to this easy-to-use indoor electric grill. The countertop appliance not only sears those tasty grill marks onto food, but its design also keeps food up and away from grease, fat, and other excess liquids for healthier cooking. The removable drip tray catches run-off fat, and by filling it first with water, it's easy to enjoy virtually smoke-free cooking. Even more, the grill provides a handy \"on\" indicator light, two rack levels for cooking delicate foods, and an adjustable thermostat-control knob for setting the heat at the right temperature for the job, whether it's veggie burgers, shish kabobs, red peppers, or baby potatoes. When finished, the grill, base, and drip tray clean up easily by hand or in the dishwasher. The multi-purpose indoor grill measures approximately 19-2/3 by 18-1/2 by 5-1/2 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jU3gUNlCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Toastess International","source_asin":"B002A3L7YI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1170003","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002A3L7YI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002A3L7YI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
