window.products.push({"id":1170081,"name":"Hallmark 1595QXI2995 Warner Bros. Looney Tunes Tom & Jerry Texas Tom Keepsake Christmas Ornaments","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816clkbhyWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The hilarious Antics of inch the Tom and Jerry show\" have entertained TV viewers for years. This Christmas ornament shows this famous Cartoon cat and mouse pair dressed in cowboy hats and spurs, with Tom holding a guitar and Jerry joining in the fun. This colorful ornament pays homage to the inch Texas Tom\" episode from 1950. Festive and collectible, Hallmark keepsake ornaments come ready to give in a seasonal holiday gift box. The box can also be used for ornament storage. This Hallmark keepsake ornament measures 2.4 x 3.3 x 2.3 inches and comes in a 2.9 x 5 x 2.9 gift box. Ornament is made of plastic. Designed by Jake Angell. Each piece includes one 2017 Tom and Jerry Texas Tom Christmas ornament in a gift-ready box. From preserving precious memories to commemorating special milestones, there's a keepsake ornament for everyone on your list. Hallmark has been your family-owned creator of greeting cards, gifts, gift wrap and more for over 100 years. We take deep pride in helping individuals connect in just the right way. This Hallmark original keepsake ornament features unparalleled artistry and exceptional detail. The ornament is lead-free and made for years of celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816clkbhyWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hallmark","source_asin":"B01MRBJ8P9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1170081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MRBJ8P9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MRBJ8P9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1170082,"name":"HISTORY COMPANY The Hayworth Collection “Leading Lady” Whiskey Double-Rocks Glass 2 Piece Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zUvhmiUOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Feminine Style Meets the Rocks Glass. As a dancer, her performances embodied a combination of strength and sensitivity that set her apart from other screen sirens, and made her just as popular with female audiences.  “The fun of acting is to become someone else,” said Rita Hayworth, who, as the beautiful, alluring, provocative title character in Gilda ,  brightened movie screens during the 1940s.  Anything was possible then. Things designed for women are often adaptations of something originally for men.  Not this one.  Inspired by the Hollywood style and beauty icon, each sophisticated, minimalist whiskey glass is an interplay of function and design, avoiding anything too elaborate that might upstage the spirit.  Its elegantly thin craftsmanship is completely seamless and without facets or etchings, an uncomplicated masterpiece that adds an air of romance to any occasion, designed to fit nicely in a female hand. Offered in a Gift Box of 2 Hayworth Collection “Leading Lady” Whiskey Double-Rocks Glasses, for keeping or giving.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zUvhmiUOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HISTORY COMPANY","source_asin":"B0B37MMCRT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1170082","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B37MMCRT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B37MMCRT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
