window.products.push({"id":1170122,"name":"bzyoo HyDuo Sports Water Bottle 32 Oz 2 Lids (Straw Lid, Screw On Handle Lid), Vacuum Insulated Stainless Steel Double Walled Leak Proof Hot/Cold Wate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x8syaCEdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMES W/ 2 DIFFERENT LID: The bzyoo HyDuo water bottle comes with 2 lids: The screw on lid with handle is designed for easy to carry and easy to fill and pour, especially drinks contain ice or fruits. The straw lid is great for sipping drinks without too much hassle when you are on the go. Please note that this lid is not for hot drinks. You can now switch bottle tops depending on the activity or beverage. STYLISH DESIGNS: Introducing bzyoo HyDuo 32oz double wall insulated Stainless-Steel water bottle with 2 interchangeable lids. This water bottle has unique design with powder coated finish based with embossed printing on top, not only it looks beautiful it also gives you more solid grip while holding your beverage. You can feel the amazing design embossed printing on the bottle and it will make a great fashion piece into your daily life. VACUUM INSULATION: Our bzyoo Hyduo water bottle is made from high-quality food-grade stainless steel and its 100% BPA FREE & TOXIN FREE material which provide great resistant to oxidation and corrosion. Crafted with a double-wall vacuum that will keeps liquids insulated for hours. Beverages will be kept hot for up to 10 hours and cold for up to 20 hours with the screw on lid. And it will prevent condensation from forming on the bottle’s exterior, suitable for any indoor or outdoor use. PREMIUM HYDRATION: Our bzyoo HyDuo come in 32 oz sizes with a variety of colors. Our insulated water bottles are a convenient size that will keep you hydrated without too much refilling. It will fit most backpack pockets & in your hand when adventure calls. SUSTAINABLE LIVING: At bzyoo, we are committed to be responsible for making great products to make more sustainable choices. Moving away from one time use cups and use reusable water bottle is only one of the many things we can do to help the environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x8syaCEdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bzyoo","source_asin":"B09GB1ZZDR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1170122","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GB1ZZDR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GB1ZZDR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
