window.products.push({"id":1170134,"name":"Coaster Home Furnishings Stansall Tufted Back Loveseat Grey (505202)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Spi2-8boL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Coaster Stansall Mid-Century Modern Grey Love Seat with Tufted Back measures 59\" length, 34\" width, 34\" height. Relax in this grey loveseat and dream of the good ol' days. Upholstered in a grey fabric with cappuccino finish legs, this loveseat features a tufted back and curved profile to showcase retro inspiration. Two accent pillows are include with this piece for a fun pattern contrast.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Spi2-8boL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Coaster Home Furnishings","source_asin":"B018FN8XZW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1170134","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018FN8XZW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018FN8XZW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1170135,"name":"The Lakeside Collection Harvest Floral Motif Bed Sheet Set with Pillowcases - King - 4 Pieces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r5Axm4jgL._AC_.jpg","description":"Add a visual complement to any bedspread with this floral accent bed sheet set that has a an all-over pattern of various autumn flowers. You can pick from the size that is needed for an adult’s king bed, the kid’s full and twin, or a teen’s queen size. The unique pattern adds a simple harvest accent to any bedroom and works as a visual element to draw attention to any bed covers. Twin fitted sheet fits mattresses up to 12\" deep, while the Full, Queen and King sheets fit mattresses up to 14\" deep. King set comes with king-size pillowcases. Cotton. Machine care. Set includes: Flat & Fitted sheet and 2 Pillowcases (1 with Twin) (King with King set)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r5Axm4jgL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Lakeside Collection","source_asin":"B09J9B1WWH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1170135","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J9B1WWH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J9B1WWH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1170136,"name":"Dyson Remanufactured Dyson DC07 All-Floors Cyclone Upright Vacuum Cleaner, Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31nGslwt20L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Dyson's patented Root Cyclone technology doesn't lose suction; auto-adjusts to different carpet heights, has a 17' reversible wand hose. Bagless design is hygienic and quick to empty—just pull the trigger to empty the dust. Amazon.com Designed by engineering guru James Dyson, inventor of the cyclonic vacuum, the 12-amp Dyson DC07 upright is an inspired combination of power and structural smarts. At the center of the machine's innovation is the Cyclone air path design, an eight-section chamber that creates powerful, consistent suction. The conical chambers generate 100,000 g of centrifugal force, pushing dust and dirt out of the airflow into the vacuum's 1-gallon collection cup. With no bag to clog, the vacuum's 270 air watts of suction remain steady. The large, transparent collection cup is easy to check and empties tidily--pop it off, hold it over a trash bin, and pull the trigger to release dirt without having to touch it. The DC07 also comes equipped with a multipart filtration system to improve overall air quality in the home. The HEPA filter, measuring 412 square inches in surface area, traps microscopic particulates and allergens. Expertly built, the filter is designed to last the lifetime of the machine. Suitable for bare floors and carpets, the Dyson upright features a 14-inch cleaning path and edge-cleaning bristles. A simple foot pedal switches off the brush roll for bare floors, and the nozzle automatically adjusts for changes in carpet height. The vacuum is equipped for above-floor cleaning with a cleverly stowed, quick-release 17-foot hose with a reversible, extension-wand handle. Onboard accessories include a crevice tool, a dusting brush, and an upholstery attachment, all designed to function without \"sticking\" to surfaces. Made from the same material used in crash helmets, the vacuum is unquestionably durable. Plus, the design only puts 4 pounds of weight on the handle, so pushing and turning is easy. This model comes with a 35-foot power cord and a six-month warranty. --Emily Bedard Editor's note: This is a remanufactured appliance. Remanufactured generally means that the appliance has been returned to the manufacturer, who returns the appliance to like-new condition. Some appliances may contain cosmetic blemishes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31nGslwt20L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dyson","source_asin":"B0012XIVZK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1170136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0012XIVZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0012XIVZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
