window.products.push({"id":1170370,"name":"KimKing 2016 New Generation 2 in 1 Car Humidifier+ Dual USB Port Charger Essential Oil Aroma Diffuser 5V2.1A 50ml tank","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sEsOQpZkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The air in car is very dry, if the air in your car is drying out your throat, nasal passages, and skin, a humidifier can make a big difference. Humidifiers are particularly helpful in the car when the air naturally holds less moisture, but they can be used when you are driving. And you could add your lovely essential oil in the water tank if you want the aromatherapy.  KimKing Humidifier use the latest ultrasonic cool mist humidification technology for soothing moisture on the go, makes water into super small drops, and more uniform diffusion of essential oils. Dual USB charger port design, can meet two device fast charging simultaneously, and let you enjoy the humidification at the same time. Specifications: Input: DC 12V Output: Spray DC 12V Power: Spray 1.5W-3.5W USB Port: DC 5V 2.1A/1A Water Tank Capacity: 50ML Spray Amount: 20-30ML/Hour 1.The product is protected by the auto power-off function. After continuously working for 2 hours, It will cut off the power automatically. To use the humidifier again, please turn on after adding more water.  2. Purified water is recommended. When the mist becomes thinner, please replace the sponge. Use regularly a cotton swab dipped in alcohol to clean the scale on the surface of the atomizing plate. Do not use excessive force, since that may damage the atomizing plate.  3. Water soluble essential oils are preferable. Please DO NOT use greasy aroma oils. Attentions: 1. This product can be used only when the car engine is started.  2. Please DO NOT use the humidifier when there is not enough water in the tank.  3. Purified water is highly recommended as unfiltered water would block the vaporizer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sEsOQpZkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KimKing","source_asin":"B01MTIHRQH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1170370","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MTIHRQH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MTIHRQH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
