window.products.push({"id":1170412,"name":"Memory Foam Cervical Pillow, Ergonomic Contour Orthopedic Pillows for Neck and Shoulder Pain with Arm-Rest Design, 2 in 1 Odorless Contoured Support P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h652DZKQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2 in 1 Cervical Pillow - The memory foam pillow is ergonomically designed and contoured to naturally and perfectly fit the curve of the spine, providing comfortable and healthy support for the head, neck, shoulders and spine. The sleep pillow is designed to allow you to comfortably switch between positions, allowing you to ease into an uninterrupted sleep. Wake up feeling refreshed, and any neck pain you may have suffered will fade away over time. Armrest Design: This design not only allows your arms to bend around the wings for perfect support to help you sleep without numbness, but also provides enough space for your shoulders and good nasal airflow for back, side and stomach sleepers. The internal holes of the neck pillows are designed to support your head, providing optimal support and reducing pressure on your skull, providing a comfortable and efficient night's sleep. CS COSDDI cervical pillow for all sleep positions. Quality Sleep - This neck pillow is made of premium rebound pure memory foam, non-toxic, non-allergenic, molded foam design, CertiPUR-US certified to ensure a healthy sleep. It's temperature-sensitive so the pillow fits perfectly around your neck. Premium firm yet soft enough to keep your head on a healthy angle to relieve pressure, providing maximum comfort and ensuring a healthy night's sleep. Removable Pillow Case - The neck pillow features a double breathable pillow case with zipper so it is removable and easy to clean, hand wash and machine washable. The pillow is made of hypoallergenic cotton and polyester, no pilling, soft and skin-friendly, breathable, allowing air to circulate through the pillow all night long, taking care of your skin, keeping you fresh all night long away from night sweat. Ergonomic Orthopedic Pillow - Choose our ergonomic pillows to relieve neck pain and other sleep problems, and you will experience your sleep improved in ways you never imagined. With your stiff neck problem solved, you'll not only have a pleasure mood of waking up, but you'll also sleep better at night. This is a great health care gift to show your loved ones that you care. You can buy with confidence, and if you don't like our pillows 100%, we'll be sure to help solve the problem!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h652DZKQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CS COSDDI","source_asin":"B09QYXZTKJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1170412","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QYXZTKJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QYXZTKJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
