window.products.push({"id":1170574,"name":"Green Eos Handcrafted 100% Pure Copper Pitcher – Hammered Copper Water Pitcher - Ayruveda - 2.2 liters (73 oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813A7a42llL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% PURE HAMMERED COPPER PITCHER: This hammered copper water jug brings the ancient tradition of copper water vessels to your table. Each item is crafted from 100% solid copper, both inside and out, including the handle. Individually hammered, you are getting a one-of-a-kind pitcher, holding 2.2 liters (73 oz). MINDFULNESS BY DESIGN: Crafted by expert artisans, this hammered pure copper pitcher provides a beautiful serving option for everyday and special gatherings. Its sturdy handle and elegant silhouette make filling, transporting and pouring easy, while keeping beverages chilled for long periods of time. AYURVEDA PROPERTIES: Made with 100% pure copper, this is the perfect serving pitcher to promote Aruveda health benefits. The pure copper is believed by many to have healing properties to promote health and wellness. HAND TESTED AND INSPECTED FOR QUALITY: Green EOS ensures it produces and sells only the highest quality 100% pure copper products by inspecting each item. All copper products are handmade from 100% copper, and individually inspected and packaged for your enjoyment. EASY MAINTENANCE: Cleaning your new Green EOS Copper Pitcher is simple. All you need is a mild dish soap to handwash after each use and dry with a soft cloth. These items are not dishwasher or microwave safe. Overtime it is normal for copper to develop of rich patina. To keep the exterior looking new, use copper polish or a lemon/salt combination.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813A7a42llL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Green Eos","source_asin":"B084KYGDMD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1170574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084KYGDMD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084KYGDMD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1170575,"name":"ARIGHTEX Cute Christmas Bedspread Woodland Fox Birds Pine Tree Snowflake 3 Pieces Holiday Duvet Covers Adults Kid Bedding Sets (Queen)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.58,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PnZdmzAhL._AC_SL1429_.jpg","description":"To help your comforter stay cleaner and last longer, invest in a decorative bedding duvet cover. Duvets covers are machine washable and are made with easy-to-close hidden zippers, making it easy to take on and off. PRODUCT SPECIFICATION: - Fabric: 100% lightweight microfiber,material; - Images imprinted using heat dyesublimation technique for lasting effects; - Size: 4 sizes; - CARE: no extra care, machine washable andtumble dryer safe.  AVAILABLE SIZES: Twin: 1*Duvet cover: 69 by 86 inches 2*Pillow Shams: 20 by 26 inches Full: 1*Duvet cover: 81 by 90 inches 2*Pillow Shams: 20 by 26 inches Queen: 1*Duvet cover: 90 by 90 inches 2*Pillow Shams: 20 by 36 inches King: 1*Duvet cover: 104 by 90 inches 2*Pillow Shams: 20 by 36 inches FINISH: Step 1: Lay the comforter flat on top of your mattress. Step 2: Take your duvet cover and turn it inside out. Insert your hands inside and find the two top corners. You should now be holding one corner in each hand. Step 3: With your hands inside the duvet cover, reach down to grab hold of the comforter’s top two corners Step 4: Holding the top two corner slightly, flip the duvet cover right side out over the comforter. Give it a shake and a fluff until the duvet cover falls down to cover most of the comforter. Step 5: Pull the duvet cover down. Stuff the bottom two corners of the comforter inside the bottom two corners of the duvet cover. Once everything is aligned, zip it up!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PnZdmzAhL._AC_SL1429_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARIGHTEX","source_asin":"B07DMH1S3Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1170575","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DMH1S3Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DMH1S3Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
