window.products.push({"id":1170633,"name":"MEFIT CARE Animal Food Picks for Kids - 36 Pcs Cute Cartoon Fruit Toothpicks for Bento Box, Lunch, Snacks - BPA-Free, Reusable, Fun Kids Food Picks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lbmn67oHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for a fun and easy way to make your kids’ food more appealing and healthy? Do you want to add some cuteness and creativity to your bento box, party food, or snacks? If yes, then you will love these animal food picks for kids! These adorable food picks are made of food-grade ABS material, which is BPA-free, non-toxic, and safe for your kids. They come in 36 pieces with 16 different animal designs, including black cat, dog, giraffe, monkey, panda, lion, rabbit, frog, elephant, and more. You can use them to pick fruits, vegetables, cheese, meat, cakes, cookies, or any other food that your kids like. These animal food picks are not only cute and colorful, but also functional and durable. They have smooth edges and sharp tips that can easily pierce through various foods without breaking or bending. They are also reusable and easy to clean. Just wash them with warm water and soap after each use. These animal food picks are perfect for making your kids’ lunch or snacks more fun and attractive. They can also help your kids develop their fine motor skills, hand-eye coordination, and appetite. They are great for bento box, party food, buffets, or children’s birthday parties. They can also be used as cake toppers, cupcake decorations, or craft supplies. With these animal food picks for kids, you can turn any ordinary food into a cute and delicious treat that your kids will love. They are also a great gift idea for your friends or family who have kids. Order yours today and enjoy the fun of making food with your kids!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lbmn67oHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEFIT CARE","source_asin":"B09T6VDHFH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1170633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T6VDHFH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T6VDHFH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
