window.products.push({"id":1170767,"name":"Riverside Furniture Seville Square Computer Armoire in Warm Oak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iCztVMFsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Riverside Furniture - Computer Armoires - 8985 - Riverside's products are designed and constructed for use in the home and are generally not intended for rental, commercial, institutional or other applications not considered to be household usage. Riverside uses furniture construction techniques and select materials to provide quality, durability, and value in their products. The construction of Riversideâ€s core product line consists of a combination of cabinetmaker hardwood solids and hand-selected veneers applied over medium density fiberboard (MDF) and particle board. MDF and particle board are used in quality furniture for surfaces that require stability against the varying environmental conditions in modern homes. You'll appreciate the multiple-step application of Riverside's furniture finishes. Their finishing processes involve several steps of hand sanding, applications of several types of finishing coats, padding and polishing.Finish: Warm OakDistress Level: LightMaterials: Constructed of Ash hardwood solid and Oak veneerTwo full-length doors are double-hinged to open flush with sides of cabinet for convenient access to all the interior featuresTop section features three open storage areas with a fixed shelf in each area and a task light mounted underneath on a pull-out shelfCenter monitor area features a fixed shelf with a wiring access hole, small storage area with a fixed shelf and a power control barOne pullout work surface shelf and a separate keyboard pullout shelf mounted beneath it are a double-pullout with each mounted on extension guidesLower right hand side contains two small storage drawers and one small file drawer which will accept letter or legal size filesAll drawers (except two small ones) are constructed with dovetail joinery and center/bottom file drawer are mounted on ball-bearing extension guidesWiring access holes located in back panelSpecifications:Overall product dimensions: 67\"\" H x 43\"\" W x 23\"\" D; Weight: 335 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iCztVMFsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Riverside","source_asin":"B0034T6FBM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1170767","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0034T6FBM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0034T6FBM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
