window.products.push({"id":1170770,"name":"INSE 25Kpa Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 300W Powerful Stick Vacuum, 6-in-1 Rechargeable Cordless Vacuum with 2500mAh Battery Up to 45mins Runtime, Lightwe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b7iAvbwtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quick & Deep Clean--INSE cordless vacuum cleaner is a remarkable, and cost-effective model among INSE cordless stick vacuums. The vacuum cleaner provides continuous 25Kpa extremely powerful suction in MAX mode, lightweight cordless stick vacuum instantly picks up pet hair, fine dust, debris, and large particles from carpet, hardwood floor, tile floor, marble floor, etc. 45Mins Long Runtime than Dyxon--Battery cordless vacuum not only supports strong power but also provides a longer working time and more long-lasting life than Dyxon rechargeable vacuum cleaner cordless, hence offering a whole-house clea-ning. 35-45mins in standard mode 13Kpa, 12-20mins in MAX mode 25Kpa. Super Powerful yet Ultra-Quiet--due to no friction of any carbon brush, S610’s battery stick vacuum cleaner upgraded high-power 300W brushless motor generates much less heat and less noise (70db), which results in more energy-saving and longer service life (10 years), compared with other regular brushed motors. Furthermore, rechargeable cordless vacuum 120,000 rpm fan speed brings super-strong fade-free suction power. Upgraded High-efficiency HEPA Filter--Lightweight cordless vacuum cleaner with a 5-stage fully sealed cyclone filtration system captures 99.99% of dust particles as small as 0.1micro, like pollen, pet dander, hair, etc. With a high-efficiency HEPA filter and high-density mesh filter combined, the whole filtration performance is 2x that of the normal filter. Avoid the motor blocked by micro dust, it can extend the machine's useful life, expels purified air, and avoid secondary pollution. Multi-purpose & Lightweight-- Lightweight battery vacuum cleaner with a light body, the brush tool or crevice tool can be combined with the retractable tube to clean the dust on the curtains or ceiling, and can be switched into a handheld vacuum cleaner to pick up debris on the table or in the gap between the car's seats; you can also attach the cleaner head to the main motor to clean the stairs with ease. Press one button to activate the rechargeable stick cordless vacuum cleaner and quickly empty the 1.2L extra-large dust cup, no need to touch the dirt. Compact Storage | No-worry Service--Wireless vacuum cleaner has two easy storage ways: wall-hanging mode and self-standing mode. Please Note: The HEPA filter can't be washed, you can clean it by cleaning the gadget. Each product ordered from our store comes with 24x7 online customer service and a 12-month 100% satisfactory after-sales service for the pet hair vacuum. Any concerns, we are always here.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b7iAvbwtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INSE","source_asin":"B0C8ZQ668X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1170770","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C8ZQ668X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C8ZQ668X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
