window.products.push({"id":1170798,"name":"FOMI Premium Thick Gel Cooling Sleeping Head Pillow | Shredded Memory Foam | Adjustable, Supportive Pillow for Preferred Firmness | Orthopedic Comfort","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VGKk4ytyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"FOMI's Shredded Memory Foam and Gel Pillow is moldable, without sacrificing support. The inner shredded memory foam layer provides a moldable feature to the pillow. It is encased by a layer of foam to add an element of support. The middle section then has a layer of cooling gel, covered in mesh, while the side sections are covered in a traditional pillow case. The different sections allow for you to personalize your cooling preference. Lay on the middle, cooling section for a cooling effect that lasts all night long. For a more standard pillow feel, lay on the side sections of the pillow. As your preference changes, simply move your head to accommodate. Additionally, for further customization, the shredded memory foam can be shifted to achieve your preferred thickness.The added support of the pillow allows for better alignment between your neck and body. This helps relieve neck/cervical pain and swelling related to pinched nerves, neck strain or injury, herniated discs, degenerative disc disease, stiff neck, headaches. Furthermore, the pillow retains its shape all night long without going flat, ensuring support all night, improving your quality of sleep and minimizing sleep interruptions. Designed to support your head, neck and upper back, preventing strain and injury.At 22\"X 16\" X 7\", FOMI's Shredded Memory Foam and Gel Pillow accommodates back, side or stomach sleepers, as well as pregnant women who want added stomach support. The pillow case can be unzipped and removed to wash. Enjoy the convenience that comes along with the multiple health benefits that this comfortable and sleep changing pillow provides.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VGKk4ytyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FOMI","source_asin":"B0784VDTY3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1170798","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0784VDTY3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0784VDTY3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
