window.products.push({"id":1170803,"name":"***LIMITED OFFER!*** EVA Premium Automatic Touchless Soap Dispenser (Hand Sanitizer) for Bathroom & Kitchen Countertops. Fingerprint Resistant Brushed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611aaWRrdbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you and your kids washing your hands enough? IT'S A FACT! Washing hands is the first line of defense against the spread of many illnesses; from the common cold to more serious infections, i.e: a) Meningitisb) Fluc) Hepatitis Ad) and most types of infectious diarrhea Would you love for your kids to wash their hands more often? Does your current hand soap dispenser clash with the décor in your bathroom and Kitchen? If your answer is yes to all of the above then a solution to all your problems is finally here! The EVA automatic soap dispenser uses innovative Infra-Red Technology to automatically detect your hand under the dispenser and release just the right amount of soap. You will never have to touch a regular germ-ridden soap dispenser again! The fun automation will also encourage your kids to wash their hands too! Our sleek contemporary design will modernize your kitchen & bathroom. The SMUDGE RESISTANT coating will make it EASY TO CLEAN and help maintain its great condition. With a 240ml capacity re-fill tank, there will be no need to refill regularly. Setting up EVA automatic soap dispenser is easy: 1. Open the base cover and insert 4 new AAA batteries2. Twist the top cap and open. Fill the tank with the a liquid soap or sanitizer of your choice. Close the top cap by twisting and locking.3. Keep the on/off button on the top pressed for 3 sec and wait for the red light to blink - the unit is now ON. If you wish to turn OFF the unit keep button pressed for 3 sec4. The first time you use the unit open and close the lid one time to let air bubbles escape. Place your hand underneath the dispenser and start enjoying your hands-free experience We offer a no-hassle 100% Money Back Guarantee on all purchases! (within 6 months) Click Add to Cart and try the EVA automatic soap dispenser now to keep your home GERM FREE!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611aaWRrdbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EVA","source_asin":"B01CZVRXHO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1170803","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CZVRXHO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CZVRXHO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
