window.products.push({"id":1170884,"name":"VillaWare V5230 InterBake3 - 2 Square Multibaker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VEN5NXRXL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description One compact appliance, three family favorites. The Inter-Bake3 comes with interchangeable nonstick plates that let you make waffles, pocket sandwiches, and Italian pizzelles. Electric baker has chrome housing, cool-touch handles, ready light, spill trough, and dishwasher-safe grids. Makes two 5\" square waffles or pocket sandwiches in about 3 minutes, two 4\" pizzelles in about 30 seconds. The sandwich grid is also great for omelets, brownies, muffins, and pizza pockets. Comes with instructions and recipe booklet. From VillaWare. 4Hx10Lx9W\". Amazon.com Three sets of interchangeable grids allow this 3-in-1 appliance to make two waffles, pocket sandwiches, or thin, crisp Italian pizzelle cookies equally well. The grids snap in and out easily, are nonstick, and go safely into the dishwasher. The waffle grids bake 4-1/2-inch-square Belgian waffles with deep pockets. The sandwich grids accommodate sandwiches of various thicknesses thanks to the multibaker's floating hinge. The pizzelle grids bake 4-1/2-inch-diameter cookies embossed with intricate patterns on top and bottom. The multibaker's handles and housing, which combines matte silver and bright black plastic for a sleek, contemporary look, stay cool during operation. For storage, the multibaker stands on end and has a cord-wrap on the bottom. It measures 11 inches wide, 4 inches high, and 10 inches deep and carries a one-year warranty against defects. The instruction booklet includes 32 recipes for waffles, sandwiches, and variously flavored pizzelle s. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VEN5NXRXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Villaware","source_asin":"B000065UEZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1170884","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000065UEZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000065UEZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
