window.products.push({"id":1170937,"name":"Nexlevl Beige Throw Pillow Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mcay7WVuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔PREMIUM QUALITY YOU CAN FEEL: You will feel right away that these 2 Super Soft 18 x 18 Throw Pillow Covers are made of High Quality Linen as soon as you touch them! This Set of Decorative Modern Farmhouse Cushion Shams are thoughtfully designed to further Liven up your beautiful living space and are Very Comfy to Lay on. They Perfectly fit 18\" x 18\" Pillow Inserts. Pillow Inserts Not Included. ✔PERFECT FOR INDOOR OR OUTDOOR: These 2 Medium Red Pillow Cases are Ideal to Accent or Match the Colors on your Couch, Sofa, Bed, Chair, or Love Seat whether they are in your Living Room, Bed Room, Kitchen or Outside on the Deck or Patio. Guests always seem to Love the Extra Comfort they provide when ever they visit too! ✔UNIQUE ZIPPER DESIGN: You will Love the Special Invisible Zipper Design that helps to Hide the Ultra Smooth Sliding Zipper which further Enhances the Elegant look of each Euro Pillow Sham. ✔SUPER EASY TO WASH: You will be greatly Pleased to know that you can Machine Wash and Machine Dry your Premium Square Linen Cushion Covers without fear of them Shrinking or Fading in Color. Please Machine Wash Cold Separately, Gently Cycle Only, No Bleach, Tumble Dry Low. ✔OUR INSANE GUARANTEE: When You Buy with Us, You can have Full Confidence since we Offer an Amazing Satisfaction Guarantee on Every Purchase. So if your are not Perfectly Satisfied with your new set, just Contact Us and We Will Provide a Full Refund or Replacement. Click 'Add To Cart' now before they're sold out! How to stuff your insert? 1.Unzip the cover, fold your insert. 2.Put the whole pillow in slowly and softly into the cover. 3.Tide up the corner of the pillow. 4.Zip up the cover. Package contains: 2 pillow covers. No pillow insert.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mcay7WVuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nexlevl","source_asin":"B085DK1FM1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1170937","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085DK1FM1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085DK1FM1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
