window.products.push({"id":1170986,"name":"Double Hinged Corkscrew Bottle Opener, Black + Stainless Steel Vacuum Wine Bottle Stopper - Fits Bottlenecks That Come with a Cork Such As Wine Bottle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QZBhOZRLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This wine bottle stopper is an easy to use and reusable beverage preserver when used as directed. Of course If you've ever experienced flat wine or champagne after refrigeration, then our bottle stopper is a must have item in your kitchen or restaurant. It is perfect for wine storage and insures that it remains fresh for consumption. The bottle cork or bottle cap that your beverage comes with is usually not enough to save your wine after use. What you need is a 100% airtight and leak-proof bottle stopper that will keep your wine sealed. It is suitable for glass bottles as well as plastic bottles. Our bottle stopper is made of high quality and durable stainless steel and we offer a 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE! Our stainless steel bottle stopper is specifically designed to keep beverages fresh and prolong use after they've been opened. It's multi-functional feature allows for storage of champagne, oil and vinegar. This push button wine bottle stopper is easy to apply and to remove. How to use: - To vacuum seal the wine bottle stopper place it over the mouth of the bottle and push it down with the palm of your hand. - This creates an air-tight seal. - To remove simply push or tilt the wine bottle stopper and lift after a swishing sound. The wine bottle will then release with ease. We've added the best corkscrew bottle opener to create a starter barware set. It is a great addition to your wine accessories! When you click the \"Add to Cart\" button now, you are automatically protected by our money back guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QZBhOZRLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cook's Sense","source_asin":"B00Y74IDIG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1170986","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Y74IDIG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Y74IDIG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
